Package: MultiStateTMLE
Title: Causal Inference for Multistate Event Processes via TMLE
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Helene", family = "Charlotte Wiese Rytgaard", email = "hely@sund.ku.dk", role = "aut"),
    person(given = "Bjarke", family = "Hautop Kristensen" , email = "bjarke.hautop@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Provides a framework for nonparametric causal inference with
    multistate event processes, built around stochastic intensity
    interventions, calibrated interventions, and composite estimands, and
    estimated using targeted maximum likelihood estimation (TMLE) allowing
    flexible nuisance parameter learning.
